{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45011","headline":"晚冬废溪东寺怀李司直纵 · 皎然","name":"晚冬废溪东寺怀李司直纵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"废溪无人迹，益见离思深。\n归来始昨日，恍惚惊岁阴。\n清想属遥夜，圆景当空林。\n宿昔月未改，何如故人心。\n游从间芳趾，摇落栖寒岑。\n眇眇湖上别，含情初至今。\n道流安寂寞，世路倦岖嶔。\n此意欲谁见，怀贤独难任。\n徽声反冥默，夕籁何哀吟。\n禅念破离梦，吾师诫援琴。\n耿耿已及旦，曷由开此襟。\n幽期谅未偶，胜境徒自寻。\n安得西归云，因之传素音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}